# goa_pk build/staging directory. "2025/00-fit-goa_pk.R" copies Cole's dat file
# and both model sources in here and compiles them; everything in it is
# regenerable. The tracked copy of the modified model is
# reference/goa_pk_2024_mfix.cpp.
Data/goa_pk_2024/

# Fitted objects (Data/*.Rdata) stay ignored via the repo root's *.RData rule --
# core.ignorecase is true on Windows and macOS, so that pattern catches .Rdata
# too. They are large, undiffable, and rewritten in full on every run.
#
# The shared artifact is the workbook instead:
#   Data/GOA_25_pollock_single_species_1970-2024.xlsx
# read_data() reconstructs the full data_list from it (01-build-data.R verifies
# the round-trip), and the goa_pk fits are rebuilt by 2025/00-fit-goa_pk.R.
